#: ../../source/04-workflow.rst:12 3e90f4c30ed0486a8fa45a96dbddaf7a
msgid ""
"**Investigate, then commit.** Look at the hardware, look at the library, "
"prove the setting on a sample — *then* run the batch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/04-workflow.rst:14 6ccd409cd3e1499fb48f17f0509193d8
msgid ""
"**Encode in small batches and spot-check.** A wrong setting is cheap to "
"catch on five files and expensive to discover after a thousand."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/04-workflow.rst:16 25505b2ebb854c7385449380653ca20b
msgid ""
"**Verify before you delete.** The originals stay until ``verify`` proves "
"each output is complete, length-matched, and decodable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/04-workflow.rst:18 3c3ffbcc3caa4bb793e8e5637121716c
msgid ""
"**Trust the encoder log, not the GPU graph.** Some hardware paths under-"
"report in the OS; confirm hardware use from ffmpeg itself and from CPU "
"draw."
msgstr ""

