#: ../../source/04-workflow.rst:48 d8530541632a496196618f838816635a
#, python-format
msgid ""
"GPU utilization graphs can read 0% even while a hardware encoder is busy "
"(notably Intel :term:`QSV` on older iGPUs, where the OS does not "
"attribute the media-engine path per process). Do not trust the graph. "
"Trust instead:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/04-workflow.rst:52 e9015caaa155425c8ea295e44d44a6d9
msgid ""
"``slimv test <encoder>`` — prints ``HARDWARE`` / ``SOFTWARE`` from "
"ffmpeg's own startup log."
msgstr ""

